(slower-x8-sv03-bounded-route-controller-6dof)
*title Skywalker X8 bounded route-attitude controller response
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=0.75 reference-length=0.36 dry-mass-kg=3.364 inertia-x=0.325 inertia-y=0.140 inertia-z=0.400 envelope-min-forward-speed=2 envelope-max-speed=27 envelope-max-alpha-deg=12 envelope-max-beta-deg=5
*runtime status target latitude-deg=0.0 longitude-deg=0.01 altitude-m=0.0
*runtime status route mode=great-circle start-latitude-deg=0.0 start-longitude-deg=0.0 duration-s=0.5 powered-end-s=0.5 powered-speed-mps=17.9 powered-climb-rate-mps=0.0 position-capture-gain=0.0
*runtime status guidance propnav-gain=1.5 attitude-gain=40.0 rate-damping=8.0 max-sideslip-deg=4.0
*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=20 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=180
*runtime status thermal policy=none
*trajectory 1 x8 start on 1
  *initial ecic x=6378315.0 y=0.0 z=0.0 xdt=0.0 ydt=17.9 zdt=0.0 qw=0.5332552264 qx=-0.5332552264 qy=-0.4643693180 qz=0.4643693180 time=0.0 mass=3.364 propellant_mass=0.0
  *segment 1 bounded-route-controller
    *integ dtprnt=0.05 dt=0.005
    *aero cx=(cx) cy=(cy) cz=(cz) cmx=(cmx) cmy=(cmy) cmz=(cmz)
    *fly propnav=4
    *when time>0.1 stop
*end
